Razer today introduced a new <a href="https://www.razer.com/gaming-laptops-accessories/razer-laptop-sleeve-16-with-wireless-charging-for-devices">16-inch laptop sleeve</a> that has an integrated wireless charging feature for smartphones and other small devices like earbuds. Priced at &#36;130, the sleeve includes two MagSafe-compatible wireless charging zones, so it can charge an <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/iphone/">iPhone</a> and AirPods at the same time.<br/>
